{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"i\": 1,\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"M45提供的时间距离与H15、H41、H42中的怀念、不舍及重复出现不等于真正留下相互吻合，而且解释明确否认声音断续是心理原因。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"i\": 2,\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"206–213的安慰再次成为过去、214–215触发身体对最初失重感的辨认，均有M50、M47及H41–H43支撑，悬空只是感受比喻而非心理原因。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"i\": 3,\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"“我究竟要怎样继续生活”是接在H18–H20之上的局部心理追问，后文将它明确限定为不愿永远依靠承受来维持在乎、又无法保证所珍惜之物不变，并未另立主线。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"i\": 4,\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"疲惫来自反复试图留住幸福却无法让过去重新成为现在，而解释也明确区分了再次全身心投入的力气减弱与在乎本身减弱，符合H17、H18、H22、H23、H38、H41、H42。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"readable\": \"否\",\n  \"readable_why\": \"第1条的“它”和“哪类先前材料”、第2条的分段“悬空”以及第3条的“这次回返”仍依赖听感记录或音乐段落的外部指涉，单独阅读时难以完整确定各自对应的具体情境。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "d364715f-f287-48be-8ef0-1669b698c7ce", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261028T135600128293Z", "elapsed_seconds": 296.906, "completed_utc": "2026-10-28T14:00:57.054161+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "bf76fad0e3bc8ffda313c1149fb4b0801715792c89f3247b4f540ca26dae3516", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry":